From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:02:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 150/155] GreatDANE: honest dane.surf update-log wording (round
 5b fallback)

5A-H1 / 5A-M1: replace the 5a claim that dane.surf logs only product,
version, platform and channel and does not log build ID or locale.
Until a dane.surf /update/ location with dane_update_masked is in
evidence, the honest wording is used: the automatic update check
sends those fields as parts of the request path, and dane.surf's own
access-log lines record that path (no query string, no referer) plus
status, user agent and a masked IP (/24 IPv4, /48 IPv6).

Claims are only about dane.surf's own log lines, never the server's
default log. Rare server-error logs can contain a full IP. "Full IPs
before November 10, 2026" is scoped to the older pepecoin.surf
update-check logs, which rotate out around November 25, 2026.

This commit is the fallback if Curb Appeal's dane_update_masked
location and a masked sample line do not land. Keep it available to
restore over the gated stronger-claim commit.
